</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER>Evil Priests Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

Updated March 2006.


Name: Evil Priests
Command: priests
Creator: coren
Maximum level: 35


Description:
Evil Priests originally started as a small cult with few devoted followers,
but over the years its strength, as well as the number of followers increased.
Their hatred grew with every new member. They chose to follow several evil
gods instead of being singularly devoted to any one specificly. But they are
closest to Burglefloogah and Draen-Dalar in temperment. Draen-Dalar accepts
any mortal who wishes to follow him, but his pledges must make a life time
commitment to serve only evil. For this reason initiates to the guild start
out serving only Draen-Dalar. Only after they obtain his blessings by
obtaining power and serving evil in its truest form can they expand their
horizons and commit themselves to other gods for additional power. Evil is a
general thing and everyone has a bit within them. The stronger the evil the
better and the more powerful the priest. The High Priest is the gods' main
link to the world therefore more powerful and has greater responsibility
within the guild itself.


Both gods smile upon those who use their evil gifts to bring evil into the
world, although it has been rumored that the harming of a newbie can have dire
consequences. For a newbie's path is uncertain that soon in life, so little,
if any, should be done to harm or hinder them. One should also strive to be
evil incarnate and avoid those that are pure of heart. For a time of reckoning
will come. And then the follower will truly know how they appear in their gods
eyes...


Joining requirements:
 Alignment must be evil (too good)
 Background must be evil_religious (wrong or incomplete)
Abilities gained when joining:
 The robes of death and destruction.
 Be Powered by the force of The Darkness.
 May study spell Detect alignment to 30%
 May study spell Cause light wounds to 40%
 May study spell Cause serious wounds to 15%
 May study spell Energy drain to 5%
 May study spell Make scar to 5%
 May study spell Mana drain to 5%
 May train skill Attack to 9%
 May train skill Cast control to 9%
 May train skill Cast generic to 28%
 May train skill Cast harm to 28%
 May train skill Cast information to 19%
 May train skill Cast magical to 4%
 May train skill Cast protection to 4%
 May train skill Cast special to 9%
 May train skill Cast teleportation to 9%
 May train skill Ceremony to 28%
 May train skill Essence eye to 19%
 May train skill Mana control to 4%


Abilities and requirements at each level:
 Level 2:
  Requirements:
   Has studied spell Cause light wounds to at least 20% (at 0%)
   Has studied spell Cause serious wounds to at least 6% (at 0%)
   Has trained skill Cast harm to at least 18% (at 0%)
  Abilities:
   May study spell Detect alignment to 47%
   May study spell Cause light wounds to 60%
   May study spell Cause serious wounds to 32%
   May study spell Energy drain to 11%
   May study spell Make scar to 12%
   May study spell Mana drain to 11%
   May train skill Attack to 24%
   May train skill Cast control to 20%
   May train skill Cast generic to 42%
   May train skill Cast harm to 39%
   May train skill Cast information to 29%
   May train skill Cast magical to 12%
   May train skill Cast protection to 14%
   May train skill Cast special to 21%
   May train skill Cast teleportation to 21%
   May train skill Ceremony to 39%
   May train skill Essence eye to 28%
   May train skill Mana control to 14%
   May study spell Cure light wounds to 5%
   May study spell Last rites to 10%
   May train skill Quick chant to 19%


